    "- **Paired t-test** checks if mean difference is significant.\n",
    "- **Wilcoxon test** provides a non-parametric check on median differences.\n",
    "- **Pearson correlation** measures linear association between tensors.\n",
    "\n",
    "Proceed by examining p-values: values below 0.05 indicate statistical significance."
